# Retro macOS Desktop UI (Single-Page HTML)

Here's a fully interactive retro macOS desktop UI (inspired by System 7/8) in a single self-contained HTML file. It includes:
- Classic Finder windows
- Interactive menu bar
- Desktop icons with drag-and-drop
- System sounds
- Working calculator
- Simple text editor
- System preferences
- And more!

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Retro macOS Desktop</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --window-bg: #c0c0c0;
            --window-border-dark: #808080;
            --window-border-light: #ffffff;
            --title-bar-active: #000080;
            --title-bar-inactive: #808080;
            --title-bar-text: #ffffff;
            --menu-bg: #c0c0c0;
            --menu-border: #808080;
            --menu-text: #000000;
            --menu-highlight: #000080;
            --menu-highlight-text: #ffffff;
            --desktop-bg: #008080;
            --icon-label: #000000;
            --scrollbar: #808080;
            --scrollbar-thumb: #404040;
            --button-face: #c0c0c0;
            --button-shadow: #808080;
            --button-text: #000000;
            --field-bg: #ffffff;
            --field-border: #808080;
            --field-text: #000000;
            --highlight: #000080;
            --highlight-text: #ffffff;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Chicago', 'Charcoal', 'Geneva', sans-serif;
            user-select: none;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--desktop-bg);
            background-image:
                repeating-linear-gradient(
                    0deg,
                    transparent,
                    transparent 20px,
                    rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 20px,
                    rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 21px
                ),
                repeating-linear-gradient(
                    90deg,
                    transparent,
                    transparent 20px,
                    rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 20px,
                    rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 21px
                );
            height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
            cursor: default;
        }

        /* Menu Bar */
        #menu-bar {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 20px;
            background-color: var(--menu-bg);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--menu-border);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 1000;
            padding-left: 4px;
        }

        .menu-item {
            height: 100%;
            padding: 0 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
            color: var(--menu-text);
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .menu-item:hover {
            background-color: var(--menu-highlight);
            color: var(--menu-highlight-text);
        }

        .menu-dropdown {
            position: absolute;
            top: 100%;
            left: 0;
            background-color: var(--menu-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--menu-border);
            display: none;
            min-width: 180px;
            z-index: 1001;
        }

        .menu-item:hover .menu-dropdown {
            display: block;
        }

        .menu-option {
            padding: 2px 10px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--menu-text);
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .menu-option:hover {
            background-color: var(--menu-highlight);
            color: var(--menu-highlight-text);
        }

        .menu-separator {
            height: 1px;
            background-color: var(--menu-border);
            margin: 2px 0;
        }

        /* Desktop Icons */
        .desktop-icon {
            position: absolute;
            width: 32px;
            height: 48px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            padding-bottom: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .icon-image {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            background-size: contain;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-position: center;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .icon-label {
            color: var(--icon-label);
            font-size: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            padding: 0 2px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .desktop-icon.selected {
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 128, 0.3);
            border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
        }

        /* Windows */
        .window {
            position: absolute;
            background-color: var(--window-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--window-border-dark);
            box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            display: none;
            z-index: 20;
            min-width: 200px;
            min-height: 150px;
            resize: both;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .window.active {
            z-index: 30;
        }

        .title-bar {
            height: 20px;
            background-color: var(--title-bar-inactive);
            color: var(--title-bar-text);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 4px;
            font-size: 12px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .window.active .title-bar {
            background-color: var(--title-bar-active);
        }

        .title-bar-text {
            margin-left: 4px;
        }

        .window-controls {
            position: absolute;
            right: 4px;
            display: flex;
        }

        .window-control {
            width: 13px;
            height: 13px;
            margin-left: 3px;
            border: 1px solid;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .close {
            background-color: var(--window-bg);
            border-color: var(--window-border-dark);
        }

        .minimize {
            background-color: var(--window-bg);
            border-color: var(--window-border-dark);
        }

        .zoom {
            background-color: var(--window-bg);
            border-color: var(--window-border-dark);
        }

        .window-content {
            height: calc(100% - 20px);
            padding: 4px;
            overflow: auto;
        }

        /* Scrollbar */
        .window-content::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
        }

        .window-content::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background-color: var(--scrollbar);
            border: 1px solid var(--window-border-dark);
        }

        .window-content::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background-color: var(--scrollbar-thumb);
            border: 1px solid var(--window-border-dark);
            min-height: 20px;
        }

        .window-content::-webkit-scrollbar-button {
            height: 16px;
            background-color: var(--scrollbar);
            border: 1px solid var(--window-border-dark);
        }

        /* Finder Window */
        .finder-toolbar {
            height: 32px;
            background-color: var(--window-bg);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--window-border-dark);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 4px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .finder-view {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(80px, 1fr));
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 4px;
        }

        .finder-item {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            width: 64px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .finder-item-icon {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            background-size: contain;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-position: center;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .finder-item-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--menu-text);
            background-color: var(--window-bg);
            padding: 0 2px;
        }

        .finder-item.selected {
            background-color: var(--highlight);
            color: var(--highlight-text);
        }

        /* Calculator */
        .calculator {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 4px;
            padding: 4px;
        }

        .calculator-display {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
            height: 32px;
            background-color: var(--field-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--field-border);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            padding: 0 4px;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .calculator-button {
            height: 32px;
            background-color: var(--button-face);
            border: 1px solid;
            border-color: var(--button-shadow) var(--button-shadow) var(--button-face) var(--button-face);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: var(--button-text);
        }

        .calculator-button:active {
            border-color: var(--button-face) var(--button-face) var(--button-shadow) var(--button-shadow);
        }

        /* Text Editor */
        .text-editor {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border: none;
            background-color: var(--field-bg);
            font-family: 'Monaco', 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            padding: 4px;
            resize: none;
            outline: none;
        }

        /* System Preferences */
        .preferences-pane {
            padding: 8px;
        }

        .preference-section {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .preference-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            display: block;
        }

        .preference-control {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 200px;
        }

        /* About This Mac */
        .about-mac {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 16px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .mac-logo {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path fill="%23000000" d="M50 10C22.4 10 0 32.4 0 50s22.4 40 50 40 50-22.4 50-40S77.6 10 50 10zm0 70c-19.3 0-35-15.7-35-35s15.7-35 35-35 35 15.7 35 35-15.7 35-35 35z"/><path fill="%23808080" d="M50 20c-13.8 0-25 11.2-25 25s11.2 25 25 25 25-11.2 25-25S63.8 20 50 20zm0 40c-11 0-20-8.9-20-20s8.9-20 20-20 20 8.9 20 20-8.9 20-20 20z"/><path fill="%23000000" d="M50 30c-8.3 0-15 6.7-15 15s6.7 15 15 15 15-6.7 15-15-6.7-15-15-15zm0 20c-5.5 0-10-4.5-10-10s4.5-10 10-10 10 4.5 10 10-4.5 10-10 10z"/></svg>');
            background-size: contain;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .system-info {
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .copyright {
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #666;
        }

        /* Context Menu */
        .context-menu {
            position: absolute;
            background-color: var(--menu-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--menu-border);
            display: none;
            min-width: 150px;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .context-menu-item {
            padding: 2px 10px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--menu-text);
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .context-menu-item:hover {
            background-color: var(--menu-highlight);
            color: var(--menu-highlight-text);
        }

        /* Sounds */
        .sound-player {
            display: none;
        }

        /* Startup Screen */
        #startup-screen {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-color: #000;
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            z-index: 10000;
            font-family: 'Monaco', 'Courier New', monospace;
        }

        #startup-logo {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path fill="%23FFFFFF" d="M50 10C22.4 10 0 32.4 0 50s22.4 40 50 40 50-22.4 50-40S77.6 10 50 10zm0 70c-19.3 0-35-15.7-35-35s15.7-35 35-35 35 15.7 35 35-15.7 35-35 35z"/><path fill="%23808080" d="M50 20c-13.8 0-25 11.2-25 25s11.2 25 25 25 25-11.2 25-25S63.8 20 50 20zm0 40c-11 0-20-8.9-20-20s8.9-20 20-20 20 8.9 20 20-8.9 20-20 20z"/><path fill="%23FFFFFF" d="M50 30c-8.3 0-15 6.7-15 15s6.7 15 15 15 15-6.7 15-15-6.7-15-15-15zm0 20c-5.5 0-10-4.5-10-10s4.5-10 10-10 10 4.5 10 10-4.5 10-10 10z"/></svg>');
            background-size: contain;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        #startup-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        #startup-progress {
            width: 200px;
            height: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #666;
            position: relative;
            margin-top: 16px;
        }

        #startup-progress-bar {
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 0;
            height: 100%;
            background-color: #444;
            width: 0%;
            transition: width 0.5s linear;
        }

        /* Shutdown Dialog */
        #shutdown-dialog {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            display: none;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            z-index: 10000;
        }

        #shutdown-panel {
            background-color: var(--window-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--window-border-dark);
            padding: 16px;
            width: 300px;
            box-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        #shutdown-message {
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        #shutdown-buttons {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
        }

        #shutdown-cancel, #shutdown-confirm {
            padding: 4px 8px;
            margin-left: 8px;
            font-size: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        #shutdown-cancel {
            background-color: var(--button-face);
            border: 1px solid var(--button-shadow);
        }

        #shutdown-confirm {
            background-color: var(--button-face);
            border: 1px solid var(--button-shadow);
        }

        /* Drag and Drop */
        .dragging {
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        /* Status Bar */
        #status-bar {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 16px;
            background-color: var(--menu-bg);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--menu-border);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 4px;
            font-size: 10px;
            z-index: 999;
        }

        #time-display {
            margin-left: auto;
        }

        /* Fonts */
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'Chicago';
            src: url('data:font/truetype;charset=utf-8;base64,

# Retro macOS Desktop Experience

I'll create a nostalgic, interactive macOS desktop that captures the classic UI elements from Mac OS 8/9 era. This will include the iconic Platinum theme, Finder windows, application icons, and interactive elements.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Retro macOS Desktop</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: "Lucida Grande", "Geneva", sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: #3d6dac url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100" height="100" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><rect width="100" height="100" fill="%233d6dac"/><path d="M0,0 L100,100 M100,0 L0,100" stroke="%235a8ad6" stroke-width="1"/></svg>');
            height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
            user-select: none;
        }

        #desktop {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: #3d6dac;
        }

        /* Desktop Icons */
        .desktop-icon {
            position: absolute;
            width: 64px;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            padding: 8px 4px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .desktop-icon:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .desktop-icon.selected {
            background: #0000cc;
        }

        .desktop-icon img {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto 4px;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
        }

        .desktop-icon span {
            color: white;
            font-size: 11px;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            display: block;
            word-wrap: break-word;
        }

        /* Menu Bar */
        #menu-bar {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 22px;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #d0d0d0, #a0a0a0);
            border-bottom: 1px solid #808080;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 8px;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        #apple-menu {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            background: #ff0000;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin-right: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            position: relative;
        }

        #apple-menu::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 2px;
            left: 2px;
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        .menu-item {
            font-size: 12px;
            padding: 0 8px;
            color: #000;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .menu-item:hover {
            background: #0000cc;
            color: white;
        }

        #clock {
            position: absolute;
            right: 8px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #000;
        }

        /* Windows */
        .window {
            position: absolute;
            background: #d0d0d0;
            border: 1px solid #808080;
            border-radius: 6px;
            box-shadow: 3px 3px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .window-header {
            height: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #d0d0d0, #a0a0a0);
            border-bottom: 1px solid #808080;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 4px;
            cursor: move;
        }

        .window-title {
            flex: 1;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #000;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
        }

        .window-controls {
            display: flex;
        }

        .window-btn {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            margin-left: 4px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .close-btn { background: #ff5f57; }
        .minimize-btn { background: #febc2e; }
        .maximize-btn { background: #28c840; }

        .window-content {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 12px;
            overflow: auto;
            background: white;
        }

        /* Finder Window */
        .finder-content {
            display: flex;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .sidebar {
            width: 120px;
            background: #e0e0e0;
            border-right: 1px solid #c0c0c0;
            padding: 8px;
        }

        .sidebar-item {
            padding: 4px;
            font-size: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .sidebar-item:hover {
            background: #0000cc;
            color: white;
        }

        .main-content {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 8px;
        }

        .folder-icon {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 64px;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .folder-icon img {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto 4px;
        }

        .folder-icon span {
            font-size: 11px;
            display: block;
        }

        /* Dock */
        #dock {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 10px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            display: flex;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            padding: 6px 8px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
        }

        .dock-icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            margin: 0 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .dock-icon:hover {
            width: 56px;
            height: 56px;
            margin: -4px 2px;
        }

        .dock-icon img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
        }

        /* Dialog */
        .dialog {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            width: 300px;
            background: #d0d0d0;
            border: 1px solid #808080;
            border-radius: 6px;
            box-shadow: 3px 3px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            z-index: 2000;
        }

        .dialog-header {
            height: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #d0d0d0, #a0a0a0);
            border-bottom: 1px solid #808080;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 8px;
        }

        .dialog-title {
            flex: 1;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #000;
        }

        .dialog-content {
            padding: 16px;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .dialog-buttons {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            padding: 0 16px 16px;
        }

        .dialog-btn {
            padding: 4px 12px;
            background: #d0d0d0;
            border: 1px solid #808080;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-left: 8px;
        }

        .dialog-btn:hover {
            background: #e0e0e0;
        }

        /* Context Menu */
        .context-menu {
            position: absolute;
            background: #d0d0d0;
            border: 1px solid #808080;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 4px 0;
            display: none;
            z-index: 3000;
        }

        .context-item {
            padding: 4px 24px 4px 16px;
            font-size: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .context-item:hover {
            background: #0000cc;
            color: white;
        }

        /* Trash */
        #trash {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 10px;
            right: 20px;
            width: 48px;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        #trash img {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        #trash span {
            color: white;
            font-size: 11px;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div id="desktop">
        <!-- Menu Bar -->
        <div id="menu-bar">
            <div id="apple-menu"></div>
