Here is a single-file, self-contained HTML recreation of a classic macOS System 7/8/9 interface. It features the iconic "bevel" aesthetic, draggable windows, a functioning calculator, and a nostalgic desktop environment.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Classic Mac OS 7.5 Recreation</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            /* Classic System 7/8 Palette */
            --bg-color: #c0c0c0;
            --window-bg: #c0c0c0;
            --title-bar: #c0c0c0;
            --menu-bg: #c0c0c0;
            --text-color: #000;
            --bevel-light: #ffffff;
            --bevel-dark: #808080;
            --bevel-shadow: #404040;
            --active-blue: #0055e4;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            user-select: none; /* Prevent text selection to feel like an OS */
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            font-family: "Geneva", "Helvetica", "Arial", sans-serif;
            font-size: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            height: 100vh;
            width: 100vw;
            cursor: default;
        }

        /* --- 3D Bevel Utility Classes --- */
        .outset {
            border-top: 2px solid var(--bevel-light);
            border-left: 2px solid var(--bevel-light);
            border-right: 2px solid var(--bevel-dark);
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--bevel-dark);
            box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 var(--bevel-dark) inset;
        }

        .inset {
            border-top: 2px solid var(--bevel-dark);
            border-left: 2px solid var(--bevel-dark);
            border-right: 2px solid var(--bevel-light);
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--bevel-light);
            box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 var(--bevel-light) inset, -1px -1px 0 var(--bevel-shadow) inset;
        }

        /* --- Menu Bar --- */
        #menubar {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 22px;
            background: var(--menu-bg);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 4px;
            z-index: 9999;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bevel-dark);
        }

        .menu-item {
            color: var(--text-color);
            padding: 2px 6px;
            margin-right: 4px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            cursor: default;
        }

        .menu-item:hover {
            background-color: var(--active-blue);
            color: white;
        }

        .menu-divider {
            width: 1px;
            height: 14px;
            background: var(--bevel-dark);
            margin: 0 4px;
        }

        .apple-logo {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-right: 8px;
        }

        /* --- Desktop Icons --- */
        #desktop {
            position: absolute;
            top: 22px;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-start;
            padding: 20px;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .desktop-icon {
            width: 70px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .icon-image {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            /* Simple CSS shapes to mimic icons */
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Folder Icon CSS */
        .folder-body {
            width: 100%;
            height: 32px;
            background: #ffcc00;
            border-top: 2px solid var(--bevel-light);
            border-left: 2px solid var(--bevel-light);
            border-right: 2px solid var(--bevel-dark);
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--bevel-dark);
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
        }
        .folder-cap {
            width: 100%;
            height: 10px;
            background: #ffcc00;
            border-top: 2px solid var(--bevel-dark);
            border-left: 2px solid var(--bevel-dark);
            border-right: 2px solid var(--bevel-light);
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--bevel-light);
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
        }
        .folder-cap::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 10px;
            height: 100%;
            border-right: 2px solid var(--bevel-dark);
        }

        .icon-label {
            color: #000;
            background: var(--bg-color);
            padding: 2px 4px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }

        .desktop-icon.selected .icon-label {
            border: 1px dotted var(--active-blue);
        }

        /* --- Window System --- */
        .window {
            position: absolute;
            background: var(--window-bg);
            min-width: 200px;
